  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Originally a systems administrator for Subchain City's Ministry of Liquidity, \"Byte\" lost everything when the DRIP dried up. Now, haunted by the network crashes of the past, he wanders the wasteland seeking to rebuild the old systems, one baseball bat swing at a time.",
